# UI and styling

- New colors: add a token in `src/theme/tokens.css`, then use `var(--color-…)` or the Tailwind name. No new hex in components.
- Authenticated chrome and viz: BEM in `src/index.css` (`.app-*`, `.viz-*`, `.doc-*`, `.staff-*`). Keep new rules in the matching section comment.
- Auth / marketing screens: Tailwind utilities plus existing `vz-*` aliases.
- `.sample-*` classes are production styles for Overview / Holdings. Rename only with a full CSS + JSX pass.
- `.appointment-form__*` is the shared form error class. Do not invent a third error class for one form.
- Viz components take data as props. Format money / weights with `src/lib/format.ts`.
